      "message": "Correct, these are the java_imports with `\"snapshot/jars/are/invalid\"` jars. \n\nI believe the ambiguity error might have been triggered by [this](https://source.corp.google.com/h/googleplex-android/platform/build/soong/+/62aeba6724238d8c57b0c99a09f1e69771234f59:android/prebuilt.go;l\u003d563-566;bpv\u003d1;bpt\u003d0;drc\u003d972917d794e1f9a225fa3737cf648f4a8d044d31)\n\nWould you recall if you had `RELEASE_DEFAULT_MODULE_BUILD_FROM_SOURCE` set to `False`? If we do, then both the prebuilts will become preferred via the `source_build` value of the module\u0027s soong config namespaces. This require one of them to be listed in `apex_contributions` to settle the tie.\n\nI think if `RELEASE_DEFAULT_MODULE_BUILD_FROM_SOURCE` is unset, we do not need these libraries in `apex_contributions`. \n\nIf feasible, my preference would be that these libraries should not be listed in apex_contributions. But I think we can add them here if it makes it more maintaintable.",
